2023
02:33:48,875 --> 02:33:52,115
Emotional state eşittir bir önceki emotional state.

2024
02:33:52,115 --> 02:33:55,395
ve bir önceki

2025
02:33:55,395 --> 02:34:01,755
the vector of the previous emotional state.

2026
02:34:01,835 --> 02:34:04,615
